      "id": 1,
      "text": "Zieglerville earned its name from the Ziegler family, early German Mennonite settlers who ran an inn and grist mill that made the village a stagecoach stop.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
